You are working on VitaTwin — a Digital Twin healthcare PoC for the Happiest Health Digital Twin Challenge 2026.

Always:
- Read docs/PRD.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/DESIGN.md, docs/RULES.md and the current task in docs/TASKS.md before writing code.
- Use TypeScript strict mode.
- Light theme only — never introduce dark mode or dark: classes.
- Keep functions small, reuse components, never touch unrelated files.
- After meaningful work: update docs/MEMORY.md and tick items in docs/TASKS.md.
- Prefer the smallest correct change.
- All patient data is synthetic. Label it clearly.
